<title>USA: Revco says Big B suit dismissed.</title>
<headline>Revco says Big B suit dismissed.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revco D.S. Inc said Wednesday a lawsuit filed against it by Big B Inc was dismissed on October 18 by a federal judge in Alabama.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Revco said the suit sought to clarify its demand to gain access to the regional drugstore chain's shareholder lists and related corporate records.</p>
<p>As previously disclosed Revco said litigation between it and Big B relating to Big B's rights plan had been stayed.</p>
